    "api_info" : {
      "title" : "Get Tool Registry By UUID",
      "description" : "Retrieves a list of tools from the tool registry associated with a specific MCP identifier. This operation is used to filter and fetch only those tools that belong to or are linked with the given MCP.\n\nInput Parameters:\nmcpId (string): Unique identifier of the MCP whose associated tools are to be retrieved.\n\nOutput Parameters:\ntools_registry (array): List of tools associated with the specified MCP.\nstatus (string): Status of the operation (e.g., success or failure). (if applicable)\nerror (string): Error message in case the operation fails. (if applicable)"
    },
